are on the rise (https://www.retaildive.com/news/toy-prices-rising-sales-gr=
owth-2025/757310/?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-_eXDFGXEaC49mrHzQ_-910xvG6w8SoZrsHhvIcT5=
dFC0zrgBZ_FoE0uSBLprcRBd8gzgN3VTjwGkEoW_h-uNls15gteA&_hsmi=3D394117559 ) .

- Consumers love the excitement of opening them, which often compels them t=
o keep buying more until they get the specific item they want or until they=
=E2=80=99ve collected a whole series, hence why brands love them.

But that addictiveness can be risky, and for blind box fiends with adult mo=
ney, gambling $15 a pop can quickly turn into hundreds of dollars worth of =
buyer=E2=80=99s remorse (https://www.theguardian.com/lifeandstyle/2025/aug/=
18/labubu-blind-box-addiction-gambling?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-_eXDFGXEaC49mrHzQ_-=
910xvG6w8SoZrsHhvIcT5dFC0zrgBZ_FoE0uSBLprcRBd8gzgN3VTjwGkEoW_h-uNls15gteA&_=
hsmi=3D394117559 ) .

Still, for some, the temporary thrill and small joy of unboxing a cute litt=
le charm can be worth the cost =E2=80=94 especially, one millennial told (h=
ttps://www.reuters.com/business/retail-consumer/toy-makers-rush-into-blind-=
box-trend-holidays-following-labubu-craze-2025-11-14/?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-_eXD=
FGXEaC49mrHzQ_-910xvG6w8SoZrsHhvIcT5dFC0zrgBZ_FoE0uSBLprcRBd8gzgN3VTjwGkEoW=
_h-uNls15gteA&_hsmi=3D394117559 ) Reuters, in tough times like these.

=E2=80=9CIt's a nice little dopamine boost and who doesn't need that now?"

Anyway, while you decide whether to gift one this Christmas, we=E2=80=99ll =
leave you with this final thought: Isn=E2=80=99t every wrapped present a bl=
ind box of sorts?

=F0=9F=94=97 (https://thehustle.co/news/blind-boxes-are-set-to-take-over-ch=
ristmas?_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-_eXDFGXEaC49mrHzQ_-910xvG6w8SoZrsHhvIcT5dFC0zrgBZ_=
FoE0uSBLprcRBd8gzgN3VTjwGkEoW_h-uNls15gteA&_hsmi=3D394117559 )

HIGHLY RECOMMENDED

A $1B exit: It=E2=80=99s the stuff most entrepreneurs can only dream of. Bu=
t once you hit that pinnacle of success, what happens next? Ring=E2=80=99s =
founder takes you on the wild ride (https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=3DnSCWN=
IHBA5U&_hsenc=3Dp2ANqtz-_eXDFGXEaC49mrHzQ_-910xvG6w8SoZrsHhvIcT5dFC0zrgBZ_F=
